  "_README": [
    "PRIVATE demo catalog for Ferretería Roberto Leyva (León, Nicaragua).",
    "Consumed by the 'leyva' preset in api/claude.js. NOT used by /probalo.",
    "",
    "*** BLOCKING — NOTHING HERE IS VERIFIED. ***",
    "Every price below was read off screenshots of the business's own Facebook",
    "posts. No price has been traced to a specific post URL or a date. Until",
    "source_url and source_date are filled for an item, that item's price is",
    "an unsourced transcription, not a fact.",
    "",
    "Why this is worse than a generic demo: these are THEIR numbers. Showing a",
    "ferretero a stale price from his own Facebook post reads as 'this system",
    "is wrong about my own store', which is the exact opposite of the pitch.",
    "",
    "PRICE PROVENANCE:",
    "  precio: <number>  + source_url: null  -> transcribed, UNSOURCED. Usable",
    "                       only for internal rehearsal. Fill source_url +",
    "                       source_date before this is shown to the client.",
    "  precio: null      -> we have NO price. The prompt builder lists the item",
    "                       by name and specs with an explicit no-price marker,",
    "                       and the model is instructed to offer to confirm with",
    "                       the mostrador. It must NEVER invent a figure.",
    "",
    "WHAT WE DELIBERATELY DO NOT HAVE — do not add these fields:",
    "  · existencia / stock levels. We have no inventory data. There is no 'e'",
    "    field on any item here, unlike data/ferreteria-catalog.json, so the",
    "    prompt physically cannot state a stock number.",
    "  · delivery policy, delivery cost, coverage, cutoff times.",
    "  · business hours and accepted payment methods.",
    "  Adding a plausible-looking value for any of these is inventing a fact",
    "  about someone else's business. Don't.",
    "",
    "OWNER'S NAME: deliberately absent. Sources conflict between 'Roberto' and",
    "'Carlos'. Use the business name only. Do not 'fix' this by picking one.",
    "",
    "*** TRES NIVELES DE PROCEDENCIA. EL CAMPO `fuente` ES OBLIGATORIO. ***",
    "",
    "  fuente: 'estimado'",
    "      Precio NUESTRO, de mercado nicaragüense. NO es el precio de la",
    "      ferretería. El socio confirmó que sí venden el producto; la cifra la",
    "      pusimos nosotros. Si el ferretero dice que su precio es otro, tiene",
    "      razón él — el nuestro es una estimación de mercado, no su lista.",
    "",
    "  fuente: 'facebook'",
    "      Trazado a una publicación con URL y fecha. Todas son del 2025-10-10,",
    "      campaña 'PROMOCION DE INTRODUCCION'. OJO: eso es de octubre de 2025,",
    "      casi un año. Un precio con URL no es un precio vigente.",
    "",
    "  fuente: 'facebook_sin_verificar'",
    "      Transcrito de capturas, SIN URL. Incluye el grupo 'DESCUENTOS",
    "      PATRIOS' (gypsum C$370, puertas C$4,260, tablas C$1,050), que casi",
    "      con certeza YA VENCIÓ, y también Bondex, baterías y las herramientas",
    "      Caterpillar, que tampoco tienen URL.",
    "",
    "LOS TRES NIVELES SE COTIZAN IGUAL. La distinción es NUESTRA, para saber qué",
    "defendemos y qué no; el cliente ve un precio y ya. Lo que NO cambia: precio",
    "null sigue siendo incotizable, en las dos rutas.",
    "",
    "Si un precio ya cambió, esa es la respuesta buena y no una disculpa:",
    "cargamos el catálogo tal cual; ustedes lo actualizan y el asistente cambia."
